000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TRSRVINQ.
000400 AUTHOR.              LYNN BUNN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        MARCH 12, 1984.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*
001100*
      *****************************************************************
001200*    THIS IS A SUBPROGRAM CALLED BY TMTLSTAT.SOURCE.
001300*
001400*      INQUIRY OF ALL OF THE WORK ORDER NUMBERS FOR A PARTICULAR
001500*        CORPORATE CODE.  ALSO SHOWS THE QUANTITY, DATE RESERVED,
001600*        STAGE LOCATION, AND MACHINE (PER CORPORATE CODE).
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **          M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
001800*    MAY 1, 1985; ADDED TDATECHK ROUTINE AND COPYLIB. -B. WIN    TER.
001900*
002000*   10/ 9/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
002100*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
002200*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
002300*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
002400*             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
002500*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
002600*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
002700*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
002800*                                            PD RAGLOW       *
002900**************************************************************
003000*
003100*
003200*    01/29/86.
003300*      ADDED A CHECK FOR VIEW STATUS 160 AFTER EACH "VREADFIELDS"
003400*      CALL.  THIS VIEW STATUS IS A TIMEOUT OF THE VIEW SCREEN,
003500*      WHICH IS USED BY MMIS PROGRAMS CALLING THIS SUBPROGRAM.
003600*      (THRU THE MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY).  CIH.
003700*
      *C   06/10/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     DELETE WORKING STORAGE VARIABLES FOR BUF-DRESERVE
      *C     AND USE THE COPYLIB MEMBER.  ALSO CHANGE REFERENCE
      *C     TO COPYCSIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
      *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
      *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSINVPOI  CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
      *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MMM DD, CCYY  XXXNAMEXXX    XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX DESC XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
      *****************************************************************
