           MOVE "N" TO SRF-ENTER-FLAG.
           MOVE SCREEN-RESERVATION-INQUIRY TO SCREEN-BUFFER.

DCR01***** MOVE "ZCSISINQ" TO VIEW-CFNAME.
DCR01      MOVE "ZTRSRVINQ" TO VIEW-CFNAME.
           CALL "TSHWRDFM" USING SRF-COMAREA, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
             VIEW-COMAREA, BASE, STATUS-AREA, SRF-SPOOLER-REC,
             LANGUAGE-PARMS, SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO SCREEN-RESERVATION-INQUIRY.
